{{feat
|type=race
|prereq=[[gnome]], [[halfling]]
|desc=Gnomes and halflings are small creatures. As such, they gain bonuses to their [[attack roll]]s, [[armor class]], and [[hide]] checks when dealing with larger creatures.<br />
'''Note:''' Because they are so small, they cannot use the following weapons: [[dire mace]], [[two-bladed sword]], [[double axe]], [[greataxe]], [[greatsword]], [[halberd]], [[heavy flail]], [[quarterstaff]], [[scythe]], and [[spear]].
|use=automatic
|icon=ife_racial.gif
}}

==Notes==
* The list of weapons is not exhaustive. Gnomes and halflings cannot use any large-sized weapon (e.g. [[longbow]]s).
* Gnomes and halflings are also prohibited from using [[tower shield]]s.
* All medium-sized weapons are wielded [[Two-handed weapon|two-handed]] by small races.
* This feat is informative only. The bonuses are due, not to this feat, but to the races' appearances being flagged as small (in [[appearance.2da]]), resulting in the standard [[size modifier]]s being applied.